TODO items for mcstas-ess-instr-citool
======================================

* Instrument names vs. file names: For the instrpy layout the instrument name
  returned by make() must match the file name (e.g. ESS02_main), but for the
  instr layout the name in "DEFINE INSTRUMENT" is not checked. In the examples,
  all ESS01 files use "DEFINE INSTRUMENT ESSinstr_main" and both ESS03 files
  use "ESS03_Wrapper". Decide whether to enforce the name for the instr layout
  as well (and update the examples accordingly).

* Inconsistent strictness between layouts: extra files or directories under
  instr/ are errors, but under instrpy/ anything besides pyproject.toml and the
  PROJECTNAME_instr/ subdirectory is silently accepted. Decide which files are
  allowed there (README, tests/, ...) and enforce it.

* runci: MPI support in runtest.py is stubbed out (do_mpi = False, marked
  FIXME). Make it work.

* runci: The JSON test results produced by mctest are loaded but not used for
  anything (marked TODO in runtest.py). Decide what to do with them (e.g.
  summarise, store as CI artifacts, compare between runs).
